# Basic Network Configuration (Cisco)

## Objective
Learn to configure basic network settings on Cisco devices such as routers and switches.

## Tools Used
- Cisco Packet Tracer
- Cisco Router
- Cisco Switch
- PC

## Configuration Steps

### Enter Privileged Mode

Router> enable


### Enter Global Configuration

Router# configure terminal


### Set Hostname

Router(config)# hostname R1


### Configure Interface

R1(config)# interface fastethernet0/0
R1(config-if)# ip address 192.168.1.1 255.255.255.0
R1(config-if)# no shutdown


### Save Configuration

R1# copy running-config startup-config


## Verification

show ip interface brief


## Result
Successfully configured basic network settings on Cisco router.
